# Summary

  Adds Git utility helpers in vine/grapeGit.py to:

  - Run safe, read-only Git queries with optional error handling.

  - Detect changed submodule links between revisions.

  - Retrieve complete commit messages and matching commit history.

  - Check whether commits, files, or ancestor relationships exist.

  - Discover and normalize local merge-request refs.

  - Read files from Git revisions.

  - List refs containing a commit.

  - Resolve references to verified commit SHAs.

